cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this workflow, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
title: callbench
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Daneshpajouh
    given-names: Amir
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Daneshpajouh/callbench"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake 9 workflow that calls germline small variants from short reads
  with bcftools and FreeBayes, benchmarks the calls against the Genome in a
  Bottle HG002 v4.2.1 truth set with RTG vcfeval, stratifies the results by
  GA4GH/GIAB v3.3 stratification regions, and annotates the calls with ClinVar.
keywords:
  - Snakemake
  - germline variant calling
  - small variants
  - variant calling benchmark
  - bcftools
  - FreeBayes
  - RTG vcfeval
  - Genome in a Bottle
  - HG002
  - GA4GH benchmarking
  - ClinVar
  - reproducible workflows
